OL,3,AExtra #500m announced for Welsh NHS as
OL,4,AReform boycotts First Minister's
OL,5,AQuestions
OL,6,
OL,7,FRhun ap Iorwerth is taking questions
OL,8,Ffrom Senedd members and opposition
OL,9,Fparty leaders in the Welsh Parliament
OL,11,FFirst Minister's Questions comes ahead
OL,12,Fof the Welsh government's budget
OL,13,Fstatement, with details of the tax and
OL,14,Fspending plans showing an extra #500m
OL,15,Ffor the NHS
OL,17,FBut Reform UK continue its boycott of
OL,18,Fthe parliament after one of its members
OL,19,Fwas banned from speaking
OL,21,FAp Iorwerth calls Reform's boycott a
OL,22,F"dereliction of duty"
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
